      "title": "How it works",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "At the pinned commit, __evict_exclusive increments cache_eviction_blocked_hazard and returns EBUSY when its hazard check finds a match. The exported hazard pointer blocked page eviction metric therefore records that specific rejection; Alibaba documents it separately from application-thread evictions and generic forced-eviction failures. (medium confidence)",
