      "title": "Problems, failure modes and limitations",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "At commit a29c220e48d132838c2ad005963af193b3654c17, __wt_hazard_set_func writes hp->ref, executes WT_FULL_BARRIER, and rechecks WT_REF_MEM. Failure clears the slot and reports busy; success uses an acquire barrier. This pairs with eviction locking the reference before checking hazards. (medium confidence)",
